Fixture tree for the lib-modules suite. Every entry here exists to pin one
branch of the walkers in lib/modules.nix, so nothing in it is arbitrary:

  alpha.nix           a plain .nix file; the ordinary case
  default.nix         must be skipped by mapModules, even though it is a .nix
  _hidden.nix         '_' prefix; must be skipped
  _hiddendir/         '_' prefix on a directory; must be skipped
  beta/default.nix    a directory with a default.nix; mapModules takes the dir
  gamma/inner.nix     a directory WITHOUT a default.nix; mapModules skips it,
                      but mapModulesRec' still recurses into it
  notes.txt           not a .nix file; must be skipped

The '.d' suffix is what keeps this directory out of collectSuites in
test/nixos/_lib.nix, matching the fixture convention in test/hey/.
